      "notes": "Nondefault Rydberg-Vinet alternative from Table I. Published V0=34.3(5) cm^3/mol converts to 56.956490004062935 A^3/B2 conventional cell with Z=1 and exact Avogadro constant. All five listed parameters are fitted; theta0=235 K, Tr=300 K, n=2 are held fixed. Fit includes all 123 Dewaele room-temperature rows and all 155 author-deposited Chidester effective-temperature rows. The integrated-Gruneisen Debye relation reproduces the complete fit. Dewaele and high-temperature Pt-derived pressures retain distinct calibration ancestry. KCl effective temperatures depend on the laser-heating gradient model; they are not directly measured homogeneous temperatures.",
